{"ref":"BDB, אֵיפֹה","hw":"אֵיפֹה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֵיפֹה</span></big>  <strong>(</strong>from <span dir=\"rtl\">אַי</span> & <span dir=\"rtl\">פֹּה</span> <em>here</em><strong>) adv. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  <strong> where</strong>? <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:16\" href=\"/Genesis.37.16\">Gn 37:16</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 19:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.19.22\">1 S 19:22</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 9:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.9.4\">2 S 9:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.21\">Is 49:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.2\">Je 3:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 4:7\" href=\"/Job.4.7\">Jb 4:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 38:4\" href=\"/Job.38.4\">38:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 2:19\" href=\"/Ruth.2.19\">Ru 2:19</a>; in indirect sentence <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 36:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.36.19\">Je 36:19</a> (less common than <span dir=\"rtl\">אַיֵּה</span>, used of <em>persons</em> [contrast <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵי־זֶה</span>] and with a verb [contrast <span dir=\"rtl\">אַיֵּה</span>]).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong> of what kind</strong>? (<em>qualis?</em>) only <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:18\" href=\"/Judges.8.18\">Ju 8:18</a>.","next":"BDB, אִי³","prev":"BDB, אָן"}